#. module: account_statement_import_online_field_mapping
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_statement_import_online_field_mapping.field_online_bank_statement_provider_mapping__expression
msgid ""
"Value to write, from the raw data of the transaction: the path of a value in"
" braces, like {payer.email}, possibly within some text, like Invoice "
"{invoice.number}. Alternatives separated by | are tried in order until one "
"gives a value, like {source.payment_intent} | {source.id}."
msgstr ""
"Valore da scrivere, preso dai dati grezzi della transazione: il percorso di "
"un valore tra graffe, come {payer.email}, eventualmente dentro un testo, "
"come Fattura {invoice.number}. Le alternative separate da | si provano in "
"ordine finché una dà un valore, come {source.payment_intent} | {source.id}."
